  {"kind":"type","name":"ListFlag","sig":"type ListFlag struct { name string; short string; arg string; help string; dev bool }","lines":[65,71],"doc":"繰り返して出せる文字列の値のフラグ（List は出た順の列 — 出なければ空）"},
