  {"kind":"type","name":"UnknownFlag","sig":"type UnknownFlag error { arg int; word string; near string? }","lines":[149,153],"doc":"表に無いフラグ（near = 編集距離 2 以内の最寄りの綴り — dev のフラグも含む）"},
